_AQIidRBT-LiW1y6pWWzTBomZwzRKAYV0IyB_4eZCm4CqeA&oe=6ABE7F8C"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "4530112473982078", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313390_4530112477315411_7504059118315738841_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dVMl6h5uT90Q7kNvwG7KlTI&_nc_oc=Adr7HqUJ2l4mzfsmKm7cX2tDMr7PLFCJynh4nYQakrTd7V8zhZOM1_DkesdT6QvlBwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI0K_MiwIYszljsY4mUV2qJF0fnvGdoNesdcHMgO3Xrqw&oe=6ABE6F43"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Football Soccer Simulator Pro", "keywords": ["Football", "Soccer", "VRFS", "CleanSheet", "Simulator"], "long_description": "Master the virtual pitch in VR Football Soccer Simulator Pro, the ultimate Meta Quest VR soccer experience. Start with an in-depth tutorial to learn controls, then unleash your skills in richly detailed football (soccer) matches.\n\nPerfect your ball shooting in attacking training, sharpen your reflexes in goalkeeper mode, and enjoy classic free-kick and penalty play styles. Take on intense Playoff matches, compete in World Cup mode, and enjoy the atmosphere of a world-class stadium filled with a lively audience.\n\nOur game features high-fidelity 3D graphics and dynamic stadium crowds, making you feel the roar of the audience as you score. Choose your team from a world-class pool, select match length and settings, even flip a virtual coin on toss. Engage in intense Play-off brackets or a full World Cup mode with group stages and finals.\n\nKey features:\n\u2022\tRealistic Football Physics \u2013 Ball and player movements are fully physics-based\n\u2022\tImmersive Atmosphere \u2013 Stunning visuals captured from pro players\u2019 motions and stadium sounds make each match authentic.\n\u2022\tMultiple Game Modes \u2013 Goalkeeper Mode, Free Kick, Penalty Shootout, Practice Drills, plus full-season tournaments.\n\u2022\tTraining Drills \u2013 Hone your passing, shooting, and goalkeeping in guided exercises.\n\u2022\tPersistency \u2013 Save and resume games anytime; compete for top ranks.\n\nWhether you want to score the winning goal or save the perfect shot, VR Football Soccer Simulator Pro delivers a complete VR football experience. Download now!", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of the most realistic football simulation with VR Football Soccer Simulator Pro! Master free kicks and penalty shots with our elaborate tutorials, then dive in to become a world-class goalkeeper. Enjoy high\u2011fidelity graphics in a lively stadium with cheering crowds. Practice attacking drills and goalkeeping in dedicated training modes, or compete in Play-offs and World Cup tournaments. Choose your team, set match length, toss, and continue saved games anytime. Play now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://orionglide.com/privacy-policy-2/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Orion Glide", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://orionglide.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1233078333228899"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1038149829222710"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "818899117915549"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1045144997900396"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1045144